tools.description:
Next train departures from one Irish station within the next 90 minutes: time, train, destination, live delay, last reported position. Includes DART and commuter trains.
Use when: someone is at (or going to) a station in Ireland.
Example: {"station":"Dublin Connolly"}

Finds Irish Rail stations (Republic of Ireland and Northern Ireland lines served by Irish Rail) matching a word, with their codes.
Use when: a station name is ambiguous or misspelled.
Example: {"query":"Dublin"}
